                                <span style="font-size: 1.25rem;">📤</span> <span id="wa-creditor-role-title">من</span>: <b id="wa-creditor-acc-name" style="color: #fef08a; font-size: 1.15rem; font-weight: 900;">-</b>
                            </button>
